  "balance": {
    "baseline": "Installed Void Requiem: 67 Physical normal hit, approximately0.557-second tap-release graph, 35 signature charged by4 per normal first target. Q has two90 melee windows and two75 projectiles if all connect, with20-block teleport on10-second cooldown.",
    "tradeoff": "Harbinger has 84 base melee damage and a 370-damage committed signature that steals 8 Health per enemy. It retains 12 accepted charges and 12 Mana per signature, melee reach and no teleport or ranged projectile. Void retains faster signature charging, a signature with no Mana cost, charged leap, teleport and ranged blades.",
    "idealizedBasicDamagePerTimeAdvantageVsVoid": 0.34293915040183687,
    "basis": "84/.52 versus67/.557, before charge-release overhead, haste, player stats, defenses and hit reliability; not measured player DPS",
    "notProven": "Sustained DPS under player stats, enemy movement, blocking and enchanting requires client playtesting."
  },
